WEBVTT

00:03.130 --> 00:04.900
A new dawn breaks.

00:07.100 --> 00:08.570
Like always,

00:08.570 --> 00:13.070
it was a peaceful morning wrapped in a calm, gentle atmosphere.

00:20.180 --> 00:21.950
Good morning, O-chan.

00:25.020 --> 00:27.860
The Onikirimaru seal was protected,

00:27.860 --> 00:32.820
and a happy morning came even here to Kifu village.

00:34.200 --> 00:36.200
Good morning, Mitsuru!

00:36.200 --> 00:38.530
Good morning, Tamaki.

00:39.570 --> 00:43.000
But, being at peace now...

00:43.840 --> 00:47.870
means I'm no longer protected by everyone.

00:53.180 --> 00:54.620
It's a little lonely, isn't it?

00:56.180 --> 00:57.710
I'm off!

01:23.550 --> 01:25.410
You're late, Princess.

01:43.970 --> 01:45.970
When did I first notice

01:45.970 --> 01:47.970
That your fingers were

01:47.970 --> 01:51.670
So beautiful

01:51.940 --> 01:55.670
And when did I notice this feeling?

01:55.980 --> 01:58.950
So fast that I'll be run over

01:58.950 --> 02:01.580
I cannot keep up

02:01.580 --> 02:04.920
My fearful heart

02:04.920 --> 02:07.650
Puts on the brakes

02:08.090 --> 02:10.460
Our eyes meet

02:11.330 --> 02:12.460
We talk about something

02:12.460 --> 02:15.690
When you look at me

02:15.960 --> 02:20.400
I cannot move

02:22.000 --> 02:29.710
My beating heart is about to break

02:29.980 --> 02:33.950
The arms that catch me pull me

02:33.950 --> 02:37.990
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

02:37.990 --> 02:42.650
That I like you

02:42.990 --> 02:45.960
So much it hurts

02:45.960 --> 02:53.660
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

02:58.240 --> 03:00.830
What are you all doing here?

03:02.010 --> 03:03.480
How do I say it?

03:03.480 --> 03:06.710
We've all gotten used to seeing you off.

03:03.480 --> 03:06.480
The

03:03.480 --> 03:06.480
Tamayori's

03:03.480 --> 03:06.480
Fate

03:06.710 --> 03:10.320
So when I woke up, I found myself walking here before I knew it.

03:10.320 --> 03:11.490
Right, Takuma?

03:11.490 --> 03:12.950
That's right.

03:12.950 --> 03:15.620
Like walking a dog every day.

03:15.620 --> 03:16.990
A-A dog?

03:17.360 --> 03:19.950
Osaki Kitsune, have you been well, too?

03:21.830 --> 03:27.040
Yuichi, um, O-chan's name is O-chan.

03:27.040 --> 03:29.160
Wrong! It's Crystal Guy!

03:27.870 --> 03:29.140
Crystal Guy

03:30.140 --> 03:31.470
Zankuro Ozaki.

03:30.170 --> 03:31.500
Zankuro Ozaki

03:32.540 --> 03:35.510
Osaki Kitsune

03:33.140 --> 03:36.640
I think Osaki Kitsune is a wonderful name.

03:36.640 --> 03:38.880
It's O-chan!

03:38.880 --> 03:42.510
It sure is fun when everyone's here.

03:44.150 --> 03:46.390
It sure is, Shinji.

03:46.390 --> 03:48.760
Now then, Tamaki.

03:48.760 --> 03:51.690
And everyone else, we must go soon,

03:51.690 --> 03:53.430
or we'll be late.

03:53.430 --> 03:55.060
That's true.

03:55.500 --> 03:57.270
Then, Ohmi...

03:57.270 --> 04:01.530
Yes. I'll pay my respects to
Lady Baba before I leave.

04:05.770 --> 04:09.180
But I'm glad that everyone seems to be well.

04:09.180 --> 04:13.050
I keep telling you!

04:13.050 --> 04:18.680
We've got special blood in our veins, so our injuries heal right away.

04:19.350 --> 04:20.550
But...

04:21.620 --> 04:24.890
We were pretty severely injured,

04:24.890 --> 04:28.390
so I'm sure that you worried more than usual, Tamaki.

04:28.960 --> 04:30.900
Thank you. We're fine.

04:31.230 --> 04:33.100
I'm healed, too.

04:36.900 --> 04:38.910
Amazing!

04:38.910 --> 04:41.540
Your wounds were the deepest,

04:41.540 --> 04:43.980
so I thought there'd be at least a few scars left.

04:43.980 --> 04:45.810
I am young after all.

04:45.810 --> 04:48.620
Hey! We're only a year apart.

04:48.620 --> 04:50.420
That's a big difference.

04:50.420 --> 04:53.550
Shut up! I don't want to hear about big or small!

04:53.550 --> 04:55.420
I didn't say anything about small.

05:03.160 --> 05:06.030
Y-You're a...

05:06.900 --> 05:08.270
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

05:08.270 --> 05:10.640
<i>when I first came to Kifu village,</i>

05:10.640 --> 05:13.130
<i>you're the first one I met.</i>

05:14.280 --> 05:15.640
An offering.

05:16.780 --> 05:18.270
Offering, offering.

05:19.010 --> 05:21.680
Oh, just a moment.

05:22.950 --> 05:24.110
Here.

05:31.790 --> 05:32.590
<i>And...</i>

05:33.290 --> 05:34.490
Don't go that way!

05:40.300 --> 05:41.460
Stop moving.

05:41.970 --> 05:44.470
If you panic, the gods will become uneasy.

05:44.470 --> 05:45.600
Gods?

05:48.980 --> 05:50.840
Take this and use it.

05:51.750 --> 05:54.010
Do you want to be taken to the ends of this world?

05:56.720 --> 05:58.790
Stay calm. It's all right.

05:58.790 --> 05:59.810
I'm right here.

06:01.660 --> 06:03.060
Hold it and speak:

06:03.060 --> 06:04.460
Hurry, Tathata's Command!

06:04.460 --> 06:06.020
Hurry, Tathata's Command!

06:08.630 --> 06:10.600
<i>And I was saved by Takuma.</i>

06:11.000 --> 06:12.990
<i>I arrived at Grandma's house.</i>

06:15.900 --> 06:17.500
Onikirimaru?

06:18.710 --> 06:21.180
A god's first resolution,

06:21.180 --> 06:23.510
the power to destroy the world.

06:24.050 --> 06:29.480
Since long ago, we, the Tamayori princesses, have kept it sealed away.

06:30.350 --> 06:35.480
Since that seal has weakened, the gods have become agitated.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.230
So, Tamaki,

06:38.230 --> 06:42.730
you must once again seal the Onikirimaru,

06:42.730 --> 06:45.360
as one who carries the blood of Tamayori must.

06:46.330 --> 06:50.870
<i>Grandma suddenly told me that
I was the Tamayori princess,</i>

06:50.870 --> 06:52.740
<i>and I felt so bewildered.</i>

06:53.370 --> 06:56.040
<i>But for some reason
I didn't think to run away.</i>

06:57.380 --> 06:58.540
<i>That was probably because...</i>

06:59.280 --> 07:03.480
<i>they were by my side protecting me.</i>

07:06.550 --> 07:07.560
We're late!

07:07.560 --> 07:08.590
Let's hurry.

07:08.590 --> 07:10.060
Yes!

07:09.120 --> 07:10.060
Okay!

07:10.060 --> 07:11.490
Wait for me!

07:24.640 --> 07:27.340
Huh? No one's here yet.

07:29.140 --> 07:33.770
Now that I think about it, this is where I met Mahiro.

07:34.780 --> 07:37.120
So she's the princess.

07:38.150 --> 07:39.880
Doesn't look like it.

07:49.230 --> 07:51.300
<i>A—Amazing!</i>

07:51.300 --> 07:52.390
Shut up!

07:56.070 --> 07:58.310
Don't go saying whatever you want.

07:58.310 --> 08:00.430
I'm not as strong as you say!

08:00.740 --> 08:03.070
Don't force your ideals onto me!

08:04.950 --> 08:06.140
I'm sorry.

08:06.580 --> 08:09.680
Because I haven't awakened as the Tamayori princess,

08:09.680 --> 08:11.550
I've made you all suffer.

08:12.450 --> 08:15.050
And I said those high and mighty things to you...

08:17.930 --> 08:19.060
Idiot.

08:19.060 --> 08:20.320
Right back at you.

08:24.600 --> 08:26.300
Don't make me say any more.

08:29.100 --> 08:30.610
Hurry it up, idiot!

08:30.610 --> 08:31.570
Yes!

08:45.650 --> 08:46.780
Good girl.

08:47.660 --> 08:49.360
You can see her?

08:49.360 --> 08:51.690
The Osaki fox is similar to our master.

08:53.790 --> 08:56.760
Whether you are strong or weak depends on yourself.

08:57.900 --> 08:59.660
I hope you grow up to be a good girl.

09:01.570 --> 09:04.730
From a human perspective, we're wild animals.

09:05.640 --> 09:09.680
If the seal disappears, we will be cast out,

09:09.680 --> 09:11.840
people will reject us, and we'll be persecuted.

09:13.650 --> 09:15.210
That's all we are.

09:16.820 --> 09:19.380
Why do you say things like that?

09:21.760 --> 09:25.250
You all say terrible things, and you're selfish and mean,

09:26.690 --> 09:30.190
but you're all important friends to me.

09:31.030 --> 09:34.130
Nothing else.

09:34.470 --> 09:38.030
Saying you're not human, that's...

09:43.410 --> 09:45.350
Thank you, Tamaki.

09:53.420 --> 09:54.450
You'll catch a cold.

09:55.790 --> 09:58.490
Fall is halfway over.

10:03.930 --> 10:07.100
Everyone says that it's their fate,

10:07.100 --> 10:10.070
but I can't accept that.

10:10.440 --> 10:12.210
You've heard that...

10:12.210 --> 10:15.780
the blood of the Tamayori is the most important element

10:15.780 --> 10:18.140
in protecting the Onikirimaru?

10:20.280 --> 10:25.410
Protecting the Tamayori princess is our, the Shugogo's, duty.

10:26.350 --> 10:29.020
It's not about whether you accept it or not.

10:29.320 --> 10:32.120
We simply exist for that purpose.

10:34.100 --> 10:37.030
There's no need to take everything on at once.

10:37.630 --> 10:43.830
We've all had time to come to terms with our fate.

10:50.610 --> 10:51.410
Stop!

11:00.350 --> 11:03.650
Um, are you all right?

11:05.760 --> 11:07.420
I'll help out, too.

11:12.770 --> 11:18.100
I'll take care of it, so please go outside!

11:20.310 --> 11:23.110
Did I do something to make her mad?

11:25.410 --> 11:27.750
I-Is there something on my face?

11:28.680 --> 11:30.680
No, it's nothing.

11:31.520 --> 11:32.650
I see, I see.

11:32.650 --> 11:36.990
So that's how it is. Oh, Mitsuru.

11:43.300 --> 11:45.130
It's sort of nostalgic.

11:46.170 --> 11:47.290
What is?

11:52.840 --> 11:56.180
You've been smiling to yourself for a while now.

11:56.180 --> 11:57.240
It's creepy.

12:00.780 --> 12:03.770
When did you guys get here?

12:09.390 --> 12:10.360
Vier.

12:11.690 --> 12:15.490
Yes. Did you call me, Monado Aria?

12:16.130 --> 12:18.300
Any word from headquarters?

12:18.300 --> 12:20.170
No, still nothing.

12:22.600 --> 12:24.040
Is that so?

12:28.340 --> 12:33.450
All living things contain genes, DNA,

12:33.450 --> 12:36.950
and that code is known to be common.

12:36.950 --> 12:38.750
Furthermore, similarities...

12:37.790 --> 12:39.740
<i>Who are you?</i>

12:40.050 --> 12:43.460
Who? You're asking who I am?

12:45.930 --> 12:49.660
I suppose there's a need to introduce myself.

12:51.270 --> 12:53.030
The long haired one is Eins.

12:53.970 --> 12:56.030
The man with the sickle is Zwei.

12:56.770 --> 13:00.110
The old man with the cane is Drei, the Magus.

13:00.340 --> 13:03.710
The one on top of the tree branch is Vier.

13:04.880 --> 13:06.880
And I am...

13:06.880 --> 13:10.250
the incarnation of Monado Cephelot,

13:10.250 --> 13:13.950
All of Logos, Aria Rosenberg.

13:14.320 --> 13:19.280
I've come to take something of mine.

13:28.840 --> 13:30.240
Why, Aria?

13:32.070 --> 13:33.170
Why?

13:33.170 --> 13:34.970
Why are you doing this?

13:35.510 --> 13:37.810
Because that is what is written in the Black Book.

13:38.480 --> 13:39.910
Black Book?

13:40.750 --> 13:43.080
I have my purpose.

13:43.850 --> 13:47.020
I am the holy woman, the gods' messenger.

13:47.820 --> 13:49.660
I obey the word of the gods,

13:49.660 --> 13:53.390
to release the power sleeping in the earth and make it mine.

13:54.090 --> 13:57.860
I must dispose of those who bar my path.

13:58.330 --> 13:59.730
That's all.

14:02.800 --> 14:06.870
You can't put butter on a roll.

14:06.870 --> 14:10.040
If you do, you can't soak up the sauce.

14:10.040 --> 14:12.600
Being able to soak up sauce is the roll's selling point.

14:15.220 --> 14:18.810
Have you ever thought about running away?

14:20.290 --> 14:21.650
You're the same.

14:23.820 --> 14:27.060
You were suddenly told you're the Tamayori princess,

14:27.960 --> 14:30.630
but you never ran.

14:32.900 --> 14:35.230
We must protect the Tamayori princess.

14:36.000 --> 14:38.130
We're bound by blood to protect you,

14:38.540 --> 14:42.670
but we don't do it because you're the Tamayori princess.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.780
We want to protect you.

15:00.390 --> 15:02.900
There's an oni inside me.

15:02.900 --> 15:04.830
It's not a guardian.

15:05.730 --> 15:07.740
Sealed by the Tamayori princess,

15:07.740 --> 15:09.530
it's an oni that will destroy the world.

15:10.070 --> 15:13.230
My ancestor banished that oni, right?

15:14.010 --> 15:15.910
Then, it's all right.

15:15.910 --> 15:19.310
I'll drive it out of your body.

15:20.950 --> 15:23.080
When I become the Tamayori princess,

15:23.080 --> 15:25.310
I'll free you all from that curse.

15:25.890 --> 15:27.980
I'll break your chains of duty.

15:29.120 --> 15:29.990
So...

15:30.590 --> 15:33.030
So, it's all right, Takuma!

15:48.980 --> 15:51.610
As the Tamayori princess, I command you:

15:54.350 --> 15:55.910
Calm yourself!

16:26.810 --> 16:28.680
As you can see,

16:29.520 --> 16:33.210
the Onikirimaru is in the hands of the
Tamayori princess and the guardian.

16:34.150 --> 16:37.450
Can you oppose this power?

16:39.330 --> 16:40.990
Eins, don't.

16:43.700 --> 16:44.760
Let's go.

16:46.100 --> 16:46.930
Yes.

16:51.810 --> 16:53.330
Thank you, Takuma.

16:53.670 --> 16:57.110
You suppressed the
Onikirimaru's strength.

16:57.710 --> 16:59.340
No, it wasn't me.

17:00.280 --> 17:04.080
It was because of you and my senpais, Ohmi, Shinji...

17:04.520 --> 17:06.010
All of you.

17:07.120 --> 17:09.350
Yes. Thank you.

17:09.860 --> 17:12.090
Thank you, everyone.

17:23.200 --> 17:25.600
It's over now, right?

17:26.370 --> 17:27.360
Yeah.

17:35.580 --> 17:37.520
Welcome back, everyone.

17:40.120 --> 17:43.520
Suguru, you were still here?

17:43.520 --> 17:47.730
Yes, I ran into Ashiya of the Bureau of Medicine,

17:47.730 --> 17:50.160
and we ended up talking for a while.

17:50.560 --> 17:52.000
Ashiya?

17:55.040 --> 17:56.590
Did something happen?

17:56.940 --> 18:00.270
No, just some information about Logos.

18:00.270 --> 18:01.210
Logos?

18:04.910 --> 18:07.280
It seems their hideout has been found.

18:07.820 --> 18:09.620
At the edges of this forest,

18:09.620 --> 18:13.950
they've put up a strong barrier to confuse those who approach.

18:14.790 --> 18:18.690
So, even though Inukai repeatedly searched,

18:19.390 --> 18:21.020
he couldn't find them.

18:21.630 --> 18:22.890
I'm sorry.

18:23.260 --> 18:24.430
I see.

18:24.430 --> 18:26.700
Just what that magician might do.

18:27.330 --> 18:28.390
You're right.

18:28.770 --> 18:31.000
In those confusing woods,

18:31.000 --> 18:35.240
they cannot be seen, but it seems as though their presence is still there.

18:36.610 --> 18:39.380
They haven't given up on the Onikirimaru?

18:40.810 --> 18:42.870
But it's all right, isn't it?

18:43.220 --> 18:46.120
Grandma has put up powerful barriers

18:46.120 --> 18:47.960
and is protecting it.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.260
Yeah.

18:49.260 --> 18:50.520
And even if they come,

18:50.520 --> 18:55.120
this time I'll crush them.

18:55.660 --> 18:57.200
Don't worry about it.

18:57.200 --> 18:58.170
Okay!

19:02.400 --> 19:03.800
What's wrong, Takuma?

19:04.440 --> 19:05.270
I'm fine.

19:05.610 --> 19:08.180
I think I just ate too much at lunch.

19:08.180 --> 19:11.440
What? Don't scare me like that.

19:13.650 --> 19:18.450
I see. I'll eat your dinner for you.

19:18.450 --> 19:20.620
What? I'll eat it.

19:20.620 --> 19:22.660
No, you mustn't force yourself.

19:22.660 --> 19:26.350
Wait, when did we decide that we were eating at my place?

19:27.260 --> 19:29.790
It's fine, it's fine. Don't be so stingy.

19:32.870 --> 19:33.990
Lady Baba.

19:48.650 --> 19:50.410
I'll return to headquarters first.

19:51.080 --> 19:51.980
Get ready.

19:52.590 --> 19:53.850
Understood.

19:55.660 --> 19:58.090
Please wait a moment, Monado Aria.

20:04.200 --> 20:07.030
We'll go instead.

20:17.010 --> 20:19.140
That's enough. Begone.

20:28.260 --> 20:30.720
Aria, was that all right?

20:32.830 --> 20:37.320
Without me, they cannot steal the Artifacts.

20:38.000 --> 20:40.300
Then I'll stay here, bide my time,

20:40.300 --> 20:42.530
and prepare my strategy.

21:00.090 --> 21:01.210
This is...

21:02.790 --> 21:06.160
As I thought, that wasn't enough to seal it completely.

21:06.990 --> 21:08.430
At this point,

21:08.430 --> 21:12.100
in order to temporarily suppress the Onikirimaru,

21:12.100 --> 21:14.230
we have no choice but to begin.

21:14.870 --> 21:18.400
Mitsuru, I can count on you again, right?

21:18.840 --> 21:20.910
The ceremonial offering.

21:20.910 --> 21:21.880
Yes.

21:38.960 --> 21:48.500
The red sky stains time itself as it envelops us

21:48.500 --> 21:57.280
Did you hug me back so tightly because you're worried?

21:57.840 --> 22:02.950
Tell me everything about the dream you had

22:02.950 --> 22:07.420
That you just started to say, but stopped yourself

22:07.420 --> 22:12.530
We drew each other closer with clumsy hands

22:12.530 --> 22:19.330
Let's embrace the sign guiding us to the same future

22:19.330 --> 22:28.940
Only you, only you, will I swear to love through it all

22:28.940 --> 22:38.820
So keep that smile I want to protect beside me always

22:38.820 --> 22:48.400
I'm sure it was inevitable that
I would feel your tears

22:48.400 --> 22:56.870
So I'll become a breeze that blows on your eyes

22:56.870 --> 23:02.540
I promise you

23:09.180 --> 23:11.220
Did you hear, Tamaki?

23:11.220 --> 23:12.380
About the spiriting away?

23:13.250 --> 23:14.650
Spiriting away?

23:14.650 --> 23:15.880
Yeah.

23:16.690 --> 23:19.420
It happened again yesterday, here in the village.

23:23.900 --> 23:25.990
It hasn't happened in a long time.

23:34.610 --> 23:36.870
You try too hard.

23:38.110 --> 23:40.210
Don't take it all on yourself.

23:41.780 --> 23:43.810
Rely on me more.

23:45.150 --> 23:49.280
I'll listen to any request you have.

23:55.030 --> 24:00.930
Next time: Ominous Dark Clouds
